          "tool_name": "xray__get_datasets",
          "description": "Return the Xray Datasets matching the given filters.\n\nA Dataset must pass every filter given. A filter passes if any of its values match.\nSupply at least one filter to receive Datasets.\n\nThis tool returns a list of Dataset, whose selectable fields are documented on\nget_dataset. Unlike the other list tools it is not paged, so it takes no limit\nor start argument.\nExample: 'id testIssueId parameters { name type } rows { order Values }'",
          "score": 5.163255214691162,
          "input_schema": {
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "fields": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "test_issue_ids": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "type": "array"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
